# Range-separated hybrid (full- and short-range exact exchange) in the
# complex basis, restricted; the energy equals erkale's.
System N2.xyz
Basis cc-pVDZ
Method hyb_gga_xc_wb97x
Multiplicity 1
Restricted true
ComplexBasis true
JKMethod Cholesky
DFTGrid 75 -302
ConvThr 1e-8
SaveChk complex_orbs_n2_wb97x.chk
